{"seq":2,"slug":"dock-door-type-capability-matrix","title":"月台门类型划分与能力矩阵建模（温控/危化/超限/装卸设备）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/yard-management-system-dock-door-trailer-appointment/yard-operations-dock-model/dock-door-type-capability-matrix","wordCount":3371,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"月台门类型划分与能力矩阵建模-温控-危化-超限-装卸设备\">月台门类型划分与能力矩阵建模（温控/危化/超限/装卸设备）</h1><p>跨境履约园区里最容易被低估的一句话是「把车派到 12 号门」。12 号门之所以能被派，不是因为它空着，而是因为它<strong>恰好具备这票货需要的能力</strong>：接不接 460V 岸电、允不允许放第 3 类易燃液体、升降平台能不能扛住 40 英尺重箱、门洞能不能塞进 13.6 英尺的高立方拖车。把「门」当成可互换的编号，是月台调度最早也最贵的一次建模错误——它在派门那一刻放行，然后在装卸现场用一次返工、一次温度断链或一次不合规装载把成本还回来。本文讨论把门拆成<strong>能力向量</strong>的方法，以及调度算法如何用这张矩阵做可派门筛选。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-门是一个能力向量-不是一个洞\">核心概念：门是一个能力向量，不是一个洞</h2><p>月台门物理上只是一个洞口，在调度语义里却是一组<strong>带类型的属性集合</strong>。同园区两扇相邻的门可能外观一致、能力完全不同：一扇背后是常温干仓、配 30,000 磅机械式升降平台；另一扇背后是冷藏穿堂、挂 460V 岸电插座排、配全封闭门罩与温控记录仪。把两者建成同一个 <code>dock_door</code> 实体、只留一个 <code>is_occupied</code> 字段，系统就永远无法回答「这票冻货该去哪」。因此矩阵的第一条设计原则是：<strong>主键是 <code>door_id</code>，可调度性由 <code>capability vector</code> 决定</strong>。能力位至少覆盖五个维度——几何、温控、危化、载重、装卸设备；维度可再细分，例如几何维度里门洞净宽与净高是两个独立约束，因为高立方拖车（high-cube，外部高度 13.6 英尺 / 4.11 米）常被<strong>高度</strong>而非宽度卡住。门类型划分本质上就是「哪几个能力位被点亮」：常温干仓门、温控门（细分冷藏/冷冻）、危化隔离门、重载/超限门、穿梭/贯通门、坡道平进门，直接对应下游的调度过滤逻辑（见本章 <a href=\"yard-topology-trailer-flow-model\">堆场拓扑、功能分区与拖车货物流动模型</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  R[月台门能力向量] --&gt; D1[几何&lt;br/&gt;门洞净宽净高/场地深度]&#10;  R --&gt; D2[温控&lt;br/&gt;岸电插座/温度带]&#10;  R --&gt; D3[危化&lt;br/&gt;许可分类/隔离围护]&#10;  R --&gt; D4[载重&lt;br/&gt;平台额定/地坪承重]&#10;  R --&gt; D5[设备&lt;br/&gt;平台型式/防溜车/密封]\">graph TD\n  R[月台门能力向量] --&gt; D1[几何&lt;br/&gt;门洞净宽净高/场地深度]\n  R --&gt; D2[温控&lt;br/&gt;岸电插座/温度带]\n  R --&gt; D3[危化&lt;br/&gt;许可分类/隔离围护]\n  R --&gt; D4[载重&lt;br/&gt;平台额定/地坪承重]\n  R --&gt; D5[设备&lt;br/&gt;平台型式/防溜车/密封]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>门类型</th>\n<th>点亮的核心能力位</th>\n<th>典型关联设施</th>\n<th>排除的货物</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>常温干仓门</td>\n<td>几何、常规载重</td>\n<td>机械/液压升降平台、门封</td>\n<td>温控货、危化品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>温控门（冷藏/冷冻）</td>\n<td>几何、温控、密封</td>\n<td>岸电插座、温控记录、全封闭门罩</td>\n<td>常温只需干仓的货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>危化隔离门</td>\n<td>几何、危化许可、围护</td>\n<td>独立门禁、防爆电气、防火间距</td>\n<td>与许可冲突的危化品、食品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重载/超限门</td>\n<td>几何加宽加高、高额定载重</td>\n<td>加强地坪、大吨位平台</td>\n<td>常规轻货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>贯通/穿梭门、坡道平进门</td>\n<td>几何、双向通行或无高差</td>\n<td>两侧月台、平进坡道</td>\n<td>需长时间占门的作业</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"温控门-岸电-温度带与冷链交接\">温控门：岸电、温度带与冷链交接</h2><p>温控门与普通门的差别不在门体，而在门背后那套<strong>连续冷链的证据链</strong>。国际冷链运输的基准是 UNECE 的 <strong>ATP 协定</strong>（《国际易腐食品运输及所用特种设备协定》），它把货品分成若干温度带：速冻食品 <strong>≤ -18 °C</strong>、冷冻食品 <strong>≤ -12 °C</strong>、冷藏食品约 0 至 +4 °C，医药冷链普遍 <strong>2 至 8 °C</strong>。温控门的能力位必须声明服务哪条温度带，而非笼统写「冷藏」——一扇写「冷藏」的门若把 -18 °C 的速冻柜当冷藏处理，交接那一刻就是断链。</p>\n<p>附属设施有三类。<strong>岸电（shore power）</strong>：冷藏机组在园区停靠期间靠岸基电源制冷，北美冷藏拖车机组常用 460V 三相供电，插座位数量决定同排能同时挂多少台冷机。<strong>温度记录与告警</strong>：ATP 体系与各国食品安全法规都要求运输环节可追溯温度，FDA 的 <strong>FSMA 卫生运输规则（21 CFR Part 1 Subpart O，2016-04-06 发布，一般企业 2017-04-06、符合条件的小企业 2018-04-06 起执行）</strong> 要求车辆与设备具备维持安全温度的能力、且设备可清洁，落到 YMS 上即温控门必须能接入温度读数并在超限时标为不可派。<strong>密封</strong>：门封与门罩让拖车尾部与门洞形成封闭空间、减少冷量泄漏。调度推论很直接：<strong>温控货不得被派到没有温控能力位的门，即使该门空闲且离目标库位更近</strong>；反之让温控门接常温货是资源错配——岸电插座位与门罩是稀缺资产。</p>\n<h2 id=\"危化门-许可分类-隔离与围护\">危化门：许可分类、隔离与围护</h2><p>危险品门的能力位必须建立在<strong>分类</strong>而非「是否危险」的二元标签上。美国运输部（DOT）的 <strong>49 CFR 172.504</strong> 给出运输环节的标牌（placarding）体系：<strong>Table 1</strong> 包括 1.1/1.2/1.3 类爆炸物、「有毒气体」（2.3）、「遇水放出易燃气体」（4.3）、温控型 B 类有机过氧化物（5.2）、吸入毒性物质（6.1）与「放射性黄Ⅲ」（7）；<strong>Table 2</strong> 包括易燃气体（2.1）、易燃液体（3）、氧化剂（5.1）、腐蚀品（8）、杂类（9）。更关键的是<strong>装载隔离规则</strong>：<strong>49 CFR 177.848</strong> 用隔离表规定两类危险品能否同车/同区，「<strong>X</strong>」表示不得同装同运同存，「<strong>O</strong>」表示除非物理隔离到泄漏也不混流才可同置。典型组合：1.1/1.2 类爆炸物与第 3 类易燃液体、第 8 类腐蚀性液体、2.1/2.2 类气体不得同车；第 4.2 类自燃物质与第 8 类腐蚀性液体不得同车；第 6.1 类包装组 I、危险区 A 的吸入毒性物质与第 3、8 类及 4.1–5.2 类不得同装；第 8 类腐蚀性液体必须与第 4 类易燃物、第 5 类氧化物隔离且不得置于其上方或紧邻。</p>\n<p>危化门的能力位是：<strong>许可的危险品分类集合</strong>、<strong>隔离属性</strong>（能否同时作业互不相容货物）、<strong>围护设施</strong>（独立门禁、防火间距、按 <strong>NFPA 30</strong> 要求的可燃液体操作间距、防爆/防静电电气与接地）。<strong>食品与危化不得共用作业面</strong>，稳妥做法是把危化能力位与温控/食品能力位做成互斥集合。危化能力位缺失却强行派门，后果不是效率损失而是违规装载，这是矩阵里唯一一条「宁可拒绝派门也不将就」的硬约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超限与重载门-尺寸-轴荷与超限许可\">超限与重载门：尺寸、轴荷与超限许可</h2><p>第三类能力位来自<strong>几何与载重的物理上限</strong>。北美联邦层面的车辆尺寸基线由 FHWA 的 <strong>23 CFR Part 658</strong> 体系约束：宽度上国家干线网络（National Network）通用上限 <strong>102 英寸（8 英尺 6 英寸 / 2.6 米）</strong>；高度无联邦统一上限，由各州自定，多数在 <strong>13 英尺 6 英寸至 14 英尺</strong>；超过界限需超限许可。这解释了高立方货的能力必须盯住<strong>净高</strong>：只按标准干货车设计高度的门，遇 13.6 英尺的高立方拖车会被门洞上沿卡住。载重维度的基准是<strong>升降平台（dock leveler）额定承载</strong>与<strong>地坪承重</strong>。机械式、液压式与气动式升降平台的常规额定多在 25,000 至 30,000 磅，重载型可达 35,000 至 40,000 磅；额定承载的定义与试验由美国物料搬运工业协会（MHI）发布的 <strong>ANSI MH30.1</strong>（升降平台）与 <strong>ANSI MH30.2</strong>（车辆防溜车装置）规范。平台额定不只是「货多重」，还要覆盖<strong>叉车自重加载荷</strong>——一台自重上万磅的坐驾式叉车驶上平台时，平台承受的是叉车与货物之和。因此重载门能力位应同时声明平台额定、地坪承重与允许的叉车类型。重载门稀缺，加宽门洞、加强地坪与大吨位平台的造价远高于普通门，让它接轻货是明确浪费，应在目标函数里加惩罚项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"装卸设备与门的匹配关系\">装卸设备与门的匹配关系</h2><p>门的能力位里有一维常被漏掉：<strong>门与装卸设备的匹配</strong>。同一扇门配机械式还是液压平台，决定它能否被高效率使用；有没有防溜车装置（vehicle restraint），决定叉车驶入车厢时拖车会不会前移。OSHA 的 <strong>29 CFR 1910.178(k)</strong> 要求：高速公路拖车装卸时「必须设置刹车并在后轮放置轮挡」，铁路车辆须用轮挡或其他可靠正压防护防止移动，升降平台/搭板就位时必须提供正向防护防止铁路车辆移动；同条 (n)(5) 还规定「禁止在距铁路轨道中心 8 英尺以内停车」。这意味着：<strong>一扇门若缺少防溜车能力位，就不具备合规的作业前置条件</strong>，无论其尺寸与温控多合适。配套的<strong>人员资质</strong>同样影响可派性：1910.178(l) 要求叉车操作员完成正式培训、实操演练与现场评估，评估<strong>至少每三年一次</strong>并保留认证记录。YMS 若在门的能力位外还绑定「本门当班可用的持证叉车工」，就能解释为什么有时门空着却排不出作业——瓶颈不在门，在人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"能力矩阵的数据模型与可派门筛选\">能力矩阵的数据模型与可派门筛选</h2><p>把上述维度收敛成可计算模型：门 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 的能力向量记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{c}(d) = (c_1, \\dots, c_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1799em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，一票货/车的需求向量记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{r}(t) = (r_1, \\dots, r_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1799em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。硬性可行性是逐维度覆盖判定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Feasible</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>⋀</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⪰</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Feasible}(d, t) = \\bigwedge_{k=1}^{n} \\left[\\, c_k(d) \\succeq r_k(t) \\,\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Feasible</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9535em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">⋀</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⪰</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⪰</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\succeq</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⪰</span></span></span></span></span> 表示「能力覆盖需求」的偏序——数值维度（净高、额定承载）是大于等于，集合维度（危化许可分类）是包含关系，互斥维度（食品与危化）是不相交约束。所有硬维度都满足的门才进入<strong>可派门集合</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{D}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{D}(t) = \\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6633em;vertical-align:-0.0817em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span></span></span></span></span> 时，系统必须显式报「无可行门」并把预约退回下一层（改约时段、改货、或人工例外），而不是降级到一个「看起来差不多」的门——这正是能力矩阵相对门编号建模的核心价值。可派集合之上再叠一层软性择优：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>wait</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Travel</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Scarcity</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^{*} = \\arg\\min_{d \\in \\mathcal{D}(t)} \\left[ \\alpha \\cdot T_{\\text{wait}}(d) + \\beta \\cdot \\text{Travel}(d) + \\gamma \\cdot \\text{Scarcity}(d) \\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.716em;vertical-align:-0.966em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.309em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.966em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wait</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Travel</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Scarcity</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Scarcity</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Scarcity}(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Scarcity</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是对稀缺能力位（重载、危化、温控）的占用惩罚，防止系统为让眼前这辆车少走 20 米而消耗掉全园区只有三扇的危化门。能力矩阵与容量台账是两层相邻建模：<strong>能力矩阵回答「这扇门能不能接这票货」</strong>（过滤），<strong>容量台账回答「今天这个时段这扇门还剩多少可承诺量」</strong>（计数）。混为一个字段就会出现「有能力但没档期」被误判为不可派、或「有档期但没能力」被误派的双向错误；台账侧细节见同章 <a href=\"yard-slot-capacity-inventory\">堆场车位容量台账与暂存区（staging）库存可视化</a>。最后一点：能力矩阵是<strong>随行情漂移的配置数据，不是硬编码常量</strong>——温控门可能因岸电回路检修临时降级，危化门许可分类随监管更新而变，升降平台额定承载会因结构损伤评估下调。矩阵应以配置表存储、带生效区间与变更审计，让可派性始终以当前生效的能力位为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>月台门在调度语义里是一个<strong>能力向量</strong>，至少覆盖几何、温控、危化、载重、装卸设备五个维度；门类型划分就是能力位的组合。</li>\n<li>温控门基准是 UNECE <strong>ATP 协定</strong>温度带（速冻 ≤ -18 °C、冷冻 ≤ -12 °C、冷藏约 0–4 °C、医药 2–8 °C），附属设施是岸电、温度记录告警与全封闭门罩；FDA <strong>FSMA 21 CFR Part 1 Subpart O</strong> 要求设备具备维持安全温度的能力。</li>\n<li>危化门按 <strong>49 CFR 172.504</strong> 分类与 <strong>49 CFR 177.848</strong> 隔离表建模（「X」不得同置、「O」需物理隔离），并满足 <strong>NFPA 30</strong> 的间距与围护要求；食品与危化能力位宜互斥。</li>\n<li>超限重载门受 FHWA <strong>23 CFR Part 658</strong> 尺寸界（宽 102 英寸、高多为 13.6–14 英尺）与升降平台额定承载（<strong>ANSI MH30.1</strong>，常规 25,000–30,000 磅、重载至 40,000 磅）共同约束，且额定须计入叉车自重。</li>\n<li>装卸设备能力位（平台型式、防溜车装置）是合规前提，受 <strong>OSHA 29 CFR 1910.178(k)</strong> 约束；叉车操作员资质与三年复评由 1910.178(l) 要求。</li>\n<li>可派门判定是逐维度硬覆盖的与运算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Feasible</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Feasible}(d,t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Feasible</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，空集时必须显式拒绝而非降级；择优按「等待 + 行进 + 稀缺惩罚」取最小代价。能力矩阵与容量台账是两层独立建模，能力位须支持带生效区间的动态降级与审计。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一步是预约时段如何与门容量对齐、如何在多个可行门之间择优分配，参见同 hub 章节 <a href=\"../appointment-scheduling-dock-scheduling/\">月台预约与调度</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"月台门类型划分与能力矩阵建模（温控/危化/超限/装卸设备）","id":"月台门类型划分与能力矩阵建模-温控-危化-超限-装卸设备"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：门是一个能力向量，不是一个洞","id":"核心概念-门是一个能力向量-不是一个洞"},{"level":2,"text":"温控门：岸电、温度带与冷链交接","id":"温控门-岸电-温度带与冷链交接"},{"level":2,"text":"危化门：许可分类、隔离与围护","id":"危化门-许可分类-隔离与围护"},{"level":2,"text":"超限与重载门：尺寸、轴荷与超限许可","id":"超限与重载门-尺寸-轴荷与超限许可"},{"level":2,"text":"装卸设备与门的匹配关系","id":"装卸设备与门的匹配关系"},{"level":2,"text":"能力矩阵的数据模型与可派门筛选","id":"能力矩阵的数据模型与可派门筛选"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"堆场拓扑、功能分区与拖车货物流动模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/yard-management-system-dock-door-trailer-appointment/yard-operations-dock-model/yard-topology-trailer-flow-model"},"next":{"title":"堆场车位容量台账与暂存区（staging）库存可视化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/yard-management-system-dock-door-trailer-appointment/yard-operations-dock-model/yard-slot-capacity-inventory"}}